### 贡献与科研验证身份 / Contribution and scientific-verification identity

**中文**：作者、仓库提交者、第三方贡献者、研究复核者和机构认证属于不同身份；公开开源参与经历不自动意味着外部服务认可本项目或独立复现了证据流水线

**English**: Authors, committers, third-party contributors, scientific reviewers and institutional endorsers have different identities. Public open-source participation does not establish institutional validation or independent reproduction of the pipeline

